.TH mdns-tui-browser 1 "2026-02-10" "mdns-tui-browser" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
mdns-tui-browser \- terminal-based mDNS service browser

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mdns-tui-browser
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal-based mDNS service browser built with Rust. It provides an interactive TUI interface for discovering and browsing mDNS services on the local network, with real-time updates, service filtering, and sorting capabilities.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display help message and exit.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Display version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-service-types \fISERVICE_TYPES\fR
Service types to browse for (e.g., http, _http._tcp, printer)
Auto-completes (_)service, (_)sub, .(_)[tc|ud]p and .local. suffix

.SH SERVICE TYPES
The \fB\-\-service-types\fR argument supports various formats:
.RS
.IP \(bu
Simple names: \fBhttp\fR, \fBssh\fR, \fBprinter\fR
.IP \(bu
Partial forms: \fB_http\fR, \fB_http._tcp\fR
.IP \(bu
Protocol spec: \fBhttp.tcp\fR, \fBssh.tcp\fR
.IP \(bu
Subtypes: \fBprinter.sub.http\fR
.IP \(bu
Full forms: \fB_http._tcp.local.\fR
.RE

.PP
Common service types:
.RS
.IP \(bu
\fBhttp\fR - HTTP servers
.IP \(bu
\fBssh\fR - SSH servers
.IP \(bu
\fBprinter\fR - Network printers
.IP \(bu
\fBairplay\fR - Apple AirPlay devices
.IP \(bu
\fBraop\fR - AirPlay audio devices
.RE

.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.B Navigation
.br
↑/↓ or j/k             - Navigate services list
.br
←/→ or h/l             - Switch between service types
.br
H/L                    - Page through service types
.br
Ctrl+Home/End          - Jump to first/last service type
.br
PageUp/PageDown or b/f or Space - Scroll services list by page
.br
Home/End               - Jump to first/last service
.br
Shift+↑/↓ or J/K       - Scroll service details
.TP
.B Sorting
.br
s                      - Cycle sort field forward (Host → Type → Name → Port → Addr → Time)
.br
S                      - Cycle sort field backward (Time → Addr → Port → Name → Type → Host)
.br
o                      - Toggle sort direction (↑/↓)
.TP
.B Filtering
.br
/                      - Enter quick filter mode (search across all service fields)
.br
n                      - Clear current filter
.br
d                      - Remove offline services
.br
D                      - Clear stale service types (service types with no services)
.TP
.B Other
.br
m                      - Show service metrics
.br
Ctrl+J                 - Dump current state to JSON file
.br
?                      - Toggle help popup
.br
q or Ctrl+c            - Quit the application

Quick filter mode (activated with /):
.br
Enter                  - Apply filter
.br
Esc                    - Cancel filter input
.br
Backspace              - Delete last character
.br
Any other key          - Type search text (case-insensitive)

.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.IP \(bu
Browse auto-discovered services:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser
.IP \(bu
Browse explicit service types:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser \-\-service-types "_http._tcp.local.,_ssh._tcp.local."
.IP \(bu
Browse with shortened service types:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser \-s "http,ssh"
Browse with shortened service types, specified multiple times:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser \-s http \-s ssh
.RE

